WEBVTT

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.960
(GROANING)

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.960
(GROANS)

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.480
(WAILS)

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.440
(GROANS IN MINIONESE)

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:22.200
(SLOW, CINEMATIC MUSIC)

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.000
Dude!
(LAUGHS)

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.280
Ah, I thought we lost you there
for a minute.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.720
Hey, chill, chill,
chill, chill, chill.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.360
Hey, hey, you wanna try this on,
little dude?

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.920
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (GIGGLES)

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.960
(KISSES)

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.160
Hey, hey, hey, soul brother,
where you jettin' off to?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.000
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.400
'Frisco disco!
(CHUCKLES)

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.040
It's your lucky day, kid.
I'm headed up the coast.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.720
I could drop you off on the way.
(GASPS)

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.040
Yee-haw!
(LAUGHS)

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.600
# H.E.R.: DANCE TO THE MUSIC #

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:01.080
(GARBLES REPEATEDLY)

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.600
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (GIGGLES)

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.880
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.880
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (GIGGLES)

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:13.400
La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la! Yeah!

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.240
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
(BABBLES)

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.640
(MOTORCYCLE ROARS)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.360
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.840
(HORN HONKS)

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.480
(INHALES DEEPLY)
(BLARES LOUDLY)

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.560
(WINDOW SQUEAKS)

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:26.720
(LAUGHS)

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:29.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.720
(SPEECH FADES) (LAUGHS)

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:35.760
Start with the pool.

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:37.440
This place
has gotta be spick-and-span.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.480
What are you doing?

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.120
You look like the overcooked turkey
my mom makes on Thanksgiving.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.080
(CHUCKLES) (SCREAMS)

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.360
Oh, God.
Oh, yeah. I forgot to mention,

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.440
the pool is filled
with my pet crocodiles.

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.720
(SINISTER TONE)
(GRU STUTTERS)

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.880
Yeah, well, well, doesn't scare me.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:58.000
(SPLASH)
(GRU GRUMBLES)

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:00.200
Be careful.
I can't have you lose an arm,

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.880
because I need you to
change some light bulbs after this.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.640
Here, let me show you how it's done.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.960
Betsy, knock it off!

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.560
(GRUNTS)
Hey!

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:13.640
Whoa! Oh, no! Argh!

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:18.680
Argh! Marvin, no, no! Stop that!

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:19.760
No! A-ha!

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:22.080
Whoa! Help! O-Oh, no!

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:23.560
The net!

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.560
I got you! I got you!

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:28.160
(CRUNCH)
(YELLS)

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:29.200
I don't got you.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:31.360
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.760
(IMPACT GRUNT)

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:35.160
Take my hand!
Whoa!

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.680
I got you!
(YELLS)

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.960
(GRUNTS)

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:47.480
(THEY BREATHE HEAVILY)

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.560
You could've run, but you...
but you didn't.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.400
I told you, you are
my favourite villain in the world.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.920
I could not let you
get eaten by crocodiles.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.200
Even though that would've been
kinda cool to watch.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:04.320
So... so, you wanna
be a great villain, huh?

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:07.360
(GASPS)
That's all I ever wanted.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.960
You want,
I don't know, you want me...

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.320
You want me to teach you
a thing or two?

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:14.760
Mm-hmm-hmm!

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:18.240
ECHOING:
Many fighters have asked me,

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:21.720
how did I become a great master?

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.720
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:29.000
(DRAMATIC FAST-PACED MUSIC)
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.440
(EFFORT SQUEAL)

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:36.960
Even the smallest of us
are capable of great things.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:42.160
You just dig down deep,
find your inner beast and...

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:46.880
(ELONGATED ROAR)

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:49.000
Uh... gesundheit?

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:50.960
Now you try.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:56.280
(YELLS)
(COUGHS) (YELLS MEEKLY)

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:58.200
(BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:00.360
(GROWLS LIKE A CAT)

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.600
(SIGHS)

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.120
(FAST-PACED MUSIC)
(PANTING)

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.240
Find your inner beast!

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.600
(MINIONS CHUNTER)

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.680
Stop this kick!

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.600
Whoa...
(THUD)

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.280
(SCREAMS)

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:21.760
We have a lot more work to do.
(CHUCKLES)

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.200
(FAST-PACED MUSIC)
Whoa!

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.400
Yah! Yah!

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.600
(THUDDING)
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.640
(EFFORT GRUNTS)

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.040
(SPEAKS MINIONESE SWEETLY)

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.440
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.880
(MUMBLES)

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.000
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.120
(LAUGHS)

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.600
(GROWL)
(SCREAMS)

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.600
(BARKS)

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.880
(MUTTERS MINIONESE)

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:59.160
A-a-a...
(SNEEZES)

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.640
(GASPS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.240
(KNOCKS)

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.960
(CRASHING)

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:07.400
(CLANG)

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:08.800
(CRASH)

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:13.200
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.600
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:27.280
(EFFORT GRUNTS) (SCREAMS)

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:31.360
Kevin, Stuart and Bob,
you are ready.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.560
(SPEAKS MINIONESE EXCITEDLY)

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.240
No, no, no, no, no!

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:39.720
Ready for your junior kung fu
achievement badges.

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.080
(SIGHS)
They're dead.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:46.440
(TRAFFIC NOISE) (BRAKES SCREECH)

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:50.080
First rule of heists:
always stay in character.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.440
Got it, uh, Grandpa.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.800
(DOORS CREAK)

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:57.160
Say, do you mind if we use the john?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.360
Poindexter here can't hold it in
till we get home.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.480
(DOOR CREAKS, CLOSES)

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.880
(CLUNKING)

00:06:09.280 --> 00:06:11.000
(DOORS OPEN LOUDLY) (EXPEL AIR)

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:16.440
(GASPS)
The Bank of Evil!

